OL,3,GNEWSAGirl stabbed multiple times by    
OL,4,A14-year-old boy described him as       
OL,5,A'abusive', murder trial hears          
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details 
OL,8,Fsome readers may find distressing      
OL,10,FA teenage girl who was stabbed to death
OL,11,Ftold friends the 14-year-old boy       
OL,12,Faccused of her murder was "abusive", a 
OL,13,Ftrial has heard.                       
OL,15,FLilly Jones' body was discovered face  
OL,16,Fdown in woodland close to Blaina Bowls 
OL,17,FClub in Blaenau Gwent on 22 June.      
OL,19,FThe 14-year-old had been stabbed about 
OL,20,F55 times, with multiple wounds         
OL,21,Fincluding to her neck and chest.       
